From b464656598315d6e2ecb2ae5191e085fb8343cf8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Ball=C3=B3=20Gy=C3=B6rgy?= <ballogyor@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:26:49 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Support D-Bus activation and multiple windows

Allow the application to be launched through D-Bus activation and
support opening multiple editor windows within a single instance.

Fix window-specific actions and ensure that closing an editor window
does not quit the entire application. Also fix shared text tag usage
and disconnect the style manager signal handler when the editor is
destroyed.
